{
  "note": [
    "The rig signature, written down once. lib/main.dart's rigSignatureOf",
    "and atlas_mcp.py's rig_signature_of are two implementations of it,",
    "and both suites read this file.",
    "",
    "Lower-case every bone name, sort, join with a newline, then FNV-1a",
    "over the UTF-8-ish bytes (each UTF-16 code unit low byte first, high",
    "byte after when the unit exceeds 0xFF -- every bone name in this",
    "library is ASCII), 64-bit, and take the first 12 hex digits of the",
    "16-digit unsigned form."
  ],
